>When and where is the Lojfest?

Here in Fairfax VA, though with participation via IRC (Internet Relay Chat)
at selected times.

"When" is still under determination.  It has in recent years been in the
first 2 weeks of August, but we are competing with the World Science Fiction
Convention, which will be local AND earlier than usual (and they want us to
come and talk about Lojban, too!)  That is the 2nd weekend.

Much is determined bythe schedule constraints of those who have to come from
out of town, especially John Cowan, who has of course been instrumental in
all aspects of the project and organization in recent years.  Any other
people who might come from out of town, and who have weekend pref
erences are
encouraged to let me know ASAP.

REgardless, LogFest will almost certainly be sometime during the summer
months.

